        "kind": "text",
        "text": "The user wants a plot summary of Hamlet in two sentences. Let me think about the key plot elements:\n\n1. Prince Hamlet of Denmark is visited by the ghost of his father, who reveals that Hamlet's uncle Claudius murdered him and usurped the throne (and married Hamlet's mother, Gertrude).\n2. Hamlet feigns madness while seeking to verify the ghost's claims and avenge his father, ultimately staging a play to confirm Claudius's guilt, accidentally killing Polonius, driving Ophelia to madness and death, and finally, after Claudius's plot to have him killed fails, killing Claudius in a duel—but dying himself along with his mother and nearly everyone else.\n\nLet me condense this into two sentences that capture the essence:\n\nSentence 1: The ghost of Hamlet's father appears to Prince Hamlet and reveals that his uncle Claudius murdered him, seized the throne, and married Hamlet's mother Gertrude, prompting Hamlet to feign madness as he seeks proof of the crime and plots revenge.\n\nSentence 2: After confirming Claudius's guilt through a play-within-a-play, Hamlet's hesitant quest for vengeance spirals into tragedy—Polonius is killed, Ophelia goes mad and drowns, and in the climactic duel, Gertrude, Laertes, Claudius, and Hamlet himself all die.\n\nThat's two sentences and captures the main plot arc. It should be concise but complete. The format should be exactly two sentences as requested—no headers or bullet points needed, just the summary."
